 "literal": "Wearing leaf-garment loins bearing not-capable-of / entering small waist to-distress as / beautiful soft bosom fully swelling / round striped breasts with-casket competed / \"How will she become, she of flower-like ear-ornaments?\" saying / with distressed heart conversing / anxious people's foolish town indeed.",
